<li>Radovan (c. 1065 – 1083/1089), pewaris, tetapi meninggal sebelum 1089</li>
<li>Klaudia, istri Vonick, Voivode Lapčani, Lika</li>
<li>Vinica, istri Michael (?)</li>
</ul>
